  2→title: VEX Common Patterns and Examples
  3→category: vex_reference
  4→subcategory: examples
  5→keywords: [vex, pattern, example, recipe, snippet, scatter, deform, color, group, wave, spiral, L-system]
  6→agent_relevance:
  7→  VexAuditor: 0.95
  8→  Librarian: 0.6
  9→  GraphTracer: 0.5
 10→related_documents:
 11→  - path: vex_reference/functions.md
 12→    reason: "Function signatures used in patterns"
 13→  - path: vex_reference/attributes.md
 14→    reason: "Attribute access patterns"
